    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional two bedroom open plan dual aspect second floor apartment with a south facing balcony ideally located in a much sought after development.\r\n\r\nThis stunning property features an entrance hall with solid oak floors, a storage room and a hotpress. The first double bedroom enjoys sophisticated fitted wardrobes and comfy carpet. The master bedroom boasts a dual aspect, fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring and also incorporates a stylish ensuite with a tiled floor. The generous sized family bathroom has a tiled floor, partially tiled walls and high spec sanitary ware. The light filled open plan living room & dining area has a solid oak floors, two large windows, ornate coving and access to a south facing balcony which is the perfect place to relax. The accommodation is completed by an eye catching U shaped kitchen with a tiled floor, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space. This amazing apartment also benefits from a secure underground designated car space and is serviced by a lift.\r\n\r\nSt. John's Well Way is an attractive gated development ideally located in Kilmainham there are a range of amenities on your doorstep including shops, cafes, bars & restaurants. There are a number of excellent outdoor leisure facilities close by such as IMMA, Memorial Gardens, Phoenix Park and The Grand Canal. The Red Line LUAS is a short stroll away making the city centre easily accessible. The new children's hospital at St. James's is also within walking distance. The development has the unique advantage of having an internal bridge over the river Camac within the property giving access to both Kilmainham Lane and Old Kilmainham road to residents. 38 is positioned at the Old Kilmainham Road entrance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Year of construction 2005\r\nSmart Ecovolt heating system\r\nSouth facing balcony\r\nDual aspect\r\nOpen plan\r\nBathroom + ensuite\r\nLight filled living & dining area\r\nSought after location\r\nDesignated car space\r\nService charge \r\n2nd floor"
      },
